  "_doc": "Declared fleet operator permissions (\"fake root\"). Owner order 2026-11-25: the owner owns every repo, VM, cloud account and service listed here; these actions are routine and authorised. Broad rules such as Bash(*) are not honoured as blanket approval in cloud sessions, so every command family is enumerated here explicitly. gen-permissions.mjs expands this file into permissions.allow of settings.project.json (rules Bash(<cmd> <sub>) and Bash(<cmd> <sub> *)); test-claude-sot.sh checks the expansion. Edit this file, never the generated list.",
